// Plan-grammar probe inputs for the ST-20 differential (test/plan-grammar-differential.test.mjs).
// Ported from the owner-reviewed packet probes (H heading, F fence/continuation, D duplicate, Q field form,
// N value end, U link, S file, M malformed), with the invisible characters written as escapes so the
// bytes are what the id says. `file` defaults to p.md; every probe is one plan file under the plan directory.
